['You (Candidate)', q{First — <strong>thank you, genuinely.</strong> I have enjoyed every conversation in this loop, and I am pleased it lands here. <em>May I ask a few specifics so I understand the package properly?</em>}, q{首先——<strong>真心感谢。</strong>整个流程的每一次沟通都很愉快，很高兴最终落在这里。<em>可以问几个细节吗？我想完整理解这个薪酬包。</em>}],
