['Priya (Talent Acquisition)', q{Bonus is target, tied to bank performance mostly. The review — <em>I can note it in the letter as an intent, not a guarantee.</em> The band ceiling is the ceiling — <em>but I can push the start-date and title.</em>}, q{奖金是目标值，主要挂钩全行绩效。复评——<em>我可以在信里写成意向，不写成保证。</em>带宽上限就是上限——<em>但入职时间和职级我可以去争取。</em>}],
['You (Candidate)', q{That is useful, and I appreciate the honesty about the ceiling. <strong>May I take 24 hours to review the letter properly?</strong> I would rather decide once, calmly, than negotiate twice, hurriedly.}, q{很有用，也感谢你对上限的坦诚。<strong>可以给我 24 小时认真读一遍 Offer 信吗？</strong>我宁愿冷静地决定一次，也不愿匆忙地谈判两次。}],
