['You (Candidate)', q{Tomorrow, same time. And one preview so tomorrow is short: <strong>if the review becomes an intent in writing and the title lands at Senior, I am inclined to say yes</strong> — the team and the work carried this decision more than the last 3k did.}, q{明天同一时间。先透个底让明天变短：<strong>如果复评写进书面且职级落在 Senior，我倾向于接受</strong>——团队和业务内容对这个决定的影响，大于那 3k。}],
