q{<strong>Take the 24 hours.</strong> Everyone grants it, few use it well. Read the letter with a highlighter: intent vs guarantee, target vs cap.},
q{<strong>Trade around ceilings.</strong> When the base is capped, the title, start date and review timing are the moveable parts — Priya just told you so.},
q{<strong>Preview honestly.</strong> The conditional preview only works if your conditions are real and checkable — it is a tool for the decisive, not for the hopeful.},
