{ t => 'Rust map', p => 'Take your own skill inventory and sort it into: current / rusty (weeks) / gone (would relearn). Bring the rusty bucket to your next interview unprompted.', a => q{The unprompted part is the power move: volunteering your rust map before being asked signals the self-audit habit panels prize. And "no two banks implement CI/CD alike" is usually true — say it with your rust.} },
