['Chen Wei (Shanghai)', q{Chen Wei. Follow-up from my side: <em>how do you coordinate a change that touches both Shanghai and London platforms — who approves what?</em>}, q{我是 Chen Wei。我这边追问：<em>一个同时触及上海和伦敦平台的变更怎么协调——谁批准什么？</em>}],
